diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 9b9f68d..3411011 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -3,6 +3,11 @@
 ## v1.6.0 (not released yet)
 
 * Go 1.17+ is now required.
+* Uniform record model: `reform.Struct` and `reform.View` now carry the full
+  record and table contract, and `Querier` methods no longer perform runtime
+  type assertions to distinguish records from structs. `reform.Record` and
+  `reform.Table` remain as deprecated aliases.
+* Generated code changed accordingly and should be regenerated with `reform`.
 
 ## v1.5.1 (2021-08-27, https://github.com/go-reform/reform/milestones/v1.5.1)
 
